      "side": 1,
      "message": "Providing a service without immediate \u003d true makes this a delayed DS component, so SCR only instantiates it when someone gets CallHomeTopologyService. With odl-netconf-topology alone (and at this commit in every install) nothing does, so the config DTCL is never registered and configured devices are never mounted. Could you add immediate \u003d true, as the call-home components already do?",
